decide-in: land q3fa; the sum model holds for flash, so FS/FB wait for the ncu stall split
decide-below: if the effect is still past the ruler, land it and take one ncu of layer 24's flash
  launch (the q3tail stall split) before any further flash round; if not, hold it: the step is not
  the chain the sum model says, and the max model (a tensor-bound step) is back on the table
decide-above: land it and re-fit the clock term (1.46-1.60 GHz) before FS/FB are specified
